h_tongjian_id":"e1c20758-7d5c-5478-bce4-2d60831674c3","source_start_index":10,"source_text":"秦始皇六年，蒙骜攻魏，拔长平。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、怀庆府（卷四十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"八年，封嫪毐为长信侯，与之山阳地。汉置县，属河内郡，在太...","context_before":"山阳城[县西北六十里。战国时魏邑。","source_end_index":33,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"317e0245-c746-5a21-8133-c9d5388b7ac5","source_start_index":17,"source_text":"秦始皇五年，蒙骜伐魏，拔山阳城。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/三、怀庆府（卷四十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、卫辉府（卷四十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"秦为燕邑。汉初，卢绾、刘贾与彭越复击破楚军于燕郭西。又汉...","context_before":"...秋时之南燕也。《左传》隐五年，卫人以燕师伐郑。战国属魏。","source_end_index":54,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"2d71a32e-ff44-55ed-8419-1aad4b9f9515","source_start_index":38,"source_text":"秦始皇五年，蒙骜攻魏，拔燕、虚。"},{"context_after":"，此即虚邑矣。或以为朝歌，误]。","context_before":"...封项襄为桃侯，邑于此。又虚城，亦在县东南，战国时魏邑也。","source_end_index":86,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"42fb7731-2747-5696-8bdb-3821a5195dca","source_start_index":71,"source_text":"秦始皇五年，蒙骜攻魏，拔燕、虚"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/四、卫辉府（卷四十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","内政"],"content":"1蒙驁伐魏，取酸棗、燕、虛、長平、雍丘、山陽等三十城；初置東郡。","content_fanyi":"秦将蒙骜领兵攻打魏国，夺取酸枣、燕、虚、长平、雍丘、山阳等三十座城池；开始设置东郡。","content_jianti_auto":"1蒙骜伐魏，取酸枣、燕、虚、长平、雍丘、山阳等三十城；初置东郡。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":478,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d3af045-db0e-11ef-9d3d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"赧王","people_name_jianti_auto":"赧王","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d3af08a-db0e-11ef-8604-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"劇辛","people_name_jianti_auto":"剧辛","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8d3af08b-db0e-11ef-af47-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"趙","