":"燕","place_name_jianti_auto":"燕","place_note":"都蓟城，北京","resolved_place_entity_id":70,"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8d3af097-db0e-11ef-99ba-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","resolved_place_entity_id":88,"start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8d3af098-db0e-11ef-b35e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8d3af099-db0e-11ef-b219-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","resolved_place_entity_id":88,"start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"8d3af09e-db0e-11ef-87a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","resolved_place_entity_id":88,"start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"8d3af09f-db0e-11ef-bc57-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"燕","place_name_jianti_auto":"燕","resolved_place_entity_id":70,"start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"8d3af0a0-db0e-11ef-9833-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"2初，劇辛在趙與龐煖善，已而仕燕。燕王見趙數困於秦，廉頗去而龐煖爲將，欲因其敝而攻之，問於劇辛，對曰：「龐煖易與耳！」燕王使劇辛將而伐趙。趙龐煖禦之，殺劇辛，取燕師二萬。","content_fanyi":"当初，剧辛在赵国时与庞煖交情极好，后来到燕国做官。燕王喜见赵军多次被秦军围困，廉颇已经离去，赵国改由庞煖统兵，便想趁赵国疲弱之机进攻它，于是征求剧辛的意见。剧辛回答说：“庞煖这个人很容易对付！”燕王喜于是派剧辛领兵攻打赵国。赵国的庞煖率军迎战，杀死剧辛，俘获燕军两万人。","content_jianti_auto":"2初，剧辛在赵与庞煖善，已而仕燕。燕王见赵数困于秦，廉颇去而庞煖为将，欲因其敝而攻之，问于剧辛，对曰：「庞煖易与耳！」燕王使剧辛将而伐赵。赵庞煖御之，杀剧辛，取燕师二万。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":479,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8d3af088-db0e-11ef-9886-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8d3af0a3-db0e-11ef-b148-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"以發明年合從伐秦事。從，子容翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"以发明年合从伐秦事。从，子容翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8d3af0a2-db0e-11ef-b59f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8d3af0a4-db0e-11ef-86cf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"函谷关之战 (前241年)","tongjian_id":"war_N0539"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["外交"],"content":"3諸侯患秦攻伐無已時。","content_fanyi":"各诸侯国担心秦国的攻伐兼并无休无止。","content_jianti_auto":"3诸侯患秦攻伐无已时。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":480,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8d3af0a1-db0e-11ef-b7dc-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"五年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"五年","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8d3af043-db0e-11ef-a38a-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（己未、前二四二）","year_int":-242},"message":"success","success":true}